msgstr "Deconectat!"

#. Translators: Presented when the controlled computer left the session while keyboard control was remote.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:929
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Connection interrupted. Control returned to local machine."
msgid ""
"The remote computer is no longer connected. Control returned to local "
"machine."
msgstr "Conexiunea întreruptă. Controlul a revenit la mașina locală."

#. Translators: Presented when keyboard control is back to the controlling computer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:943
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1578
msgid "Controlling local machine."
msgstr "Se controlează calculatorul local."

#. Translators: Title of the connection error dialog.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1027
msgid "Error Connecting"
msgstr "Eroare la conectare"

#. Translators: Message shown when cannot connect to the remote computer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1029
msgid "Unable to connect to the remote computer"
msgstr "Nu se poate conecta la calculatorul aflat la distanță"

#. Translators: Presented when connected to the remote computer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1172
msgid "Connected!"
msgstr "Conectat!"

#. Translators: Presented when an interrupted remote connection becomes available again. Keyboard control remains local until the user toggles it.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1175
msgid "The remote computer is available again. Control remains local."
msgstr ""
"Computerul de la distanță este din nou disponibil. Controlul rămâne local."

#. Translators: Presented when the remote connection is interrupted while keyboard control is remote.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1187
msgid "Connection interrupted. Control returned to local machine."
msgstr "Conexiunea întreruptă. Controlul a revenit la mașina locală."

#. Translators: Presented when connection to a remote computer was interrupted.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1190
msgid "Connection interrupted"
msgstr "Conexiune întreruptă"

#. Translators: A message to warn the user that handle keys from other applications should be on.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1224
msgid ""
"The option to handle keys from other applications is disabled in your NVDA "
"keyboard settings. In order to allow the keyboard of this machine to be "
"controlled, this option should be enabled. Would you like to do this now?"
msgstr ""
"Opțiunea de controlare a tastelor din alte aplicații este dezactivată din "
"setările de tastatură ale NVDA. Pentru a permite tastaturii acestui computer "
"să fie controlată, ar trebui să fie activată această opțiune. Doriți să "
"faceți asta acum?"

#. Translators: Presented in direct (client to server) remote connection when the controlled computer is ready.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1267
msgid "Connected to control server"
msgstr "Conectat la server-ul de control"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1432
msgid ""
"TeleNVDA is already connected. Disconnect before opening a new connection."
msgstr ""
"TeleNVDA este conectat deja. Deconectați-vă înainte de a deschide o nouă "
"conexiune."

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1432
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1488
msgid "TeleNVDA Already Connected"
msgstr "TeleNVDA conectat deja"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1439
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Do you wish to control the machine on server {server} with key {key}?"
msgstr "Doriți să controlați calculatorul pe server-ul {server} cu cheia{key}?"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1441
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Do you wish to allow this machine to be controlled on server {server} with "
"key {key}?"
msgstr ""
"Doriți să permiteți ca acest computer să fie controlat pe server-ul {server} "
"cu cheia {key}?"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1442
msgid "TeleNVDA Connection Request"
msgstr "Solicitare de conexiune TeleNVDA"

#. Translators: Copy link compatible with NVDA Remote gesture description
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1459
msgid ""
"Copies a link to the remote session to the clipboard compatible with both "
"NVDA Remote and TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Copiază un link către sesiunea la distanță pe planșetă compatibil atât cu "
"NVDA Remote, cât și cu TeleNVDA"

#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1467
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1479
msgid "Copied link"
msgstr "Link copiat"

#. Translators: Copy link compatible with TeleNVDA gesture description
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1471
msgid ""
"Copies a link to the remote session to the clipboard compatible only with "
"TeleNVDA"
msgstr ""
"Copiază un link către sesiunea la distanță pe planșetă compatibil numai cu "
"TeleNVDA"

#. Translators: description for the Connect gesture
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1483
msgid "Opens a dialog to start a remote session"
msgstr ""
"Deschide o fereastră de dialog pentru pornirea unei sesiuni la distanță"

#. Translators: description for the Disconnect gesture
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1494
msgid "Disconnect a remote session"
msgstr "Deconectați o sesiune la distanță"

#. Translators: description for the gesture that connects or disconnects a remote session.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1505
msgid ""
"If a remote session is active, disconnects it; otherwise opens a dialog to "
"start a remote session"
msgstr ""
"Dacă o sesiune la distanță este activă, o deconectează; în caz contrar, "
"deschide un dialog pentru a începe o sesiune la distanță"

#. Translators: gesture description for the ignoreNextGesture script
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1516
msgid ""
"Set the host to ignore the next gesture completely, sending next gesture to "
"the guest as is. Useful when you need to use the gesture asigned to toggle "
"between guest and host, in the guest machine."
msgstr ""
"Setează gazda să ignore complet următorul gest, trimițându-l la gazdă așa "
"cum e. Opțiunea este utilă atunci când trebuie să folosiți gestul atribuit "
"pentru a vă comuta de la invitat la gazdă, în computer-ul invitat."

#. Translators: Report when the next gesture will be send to the guest ignoring everything else.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1524
msgid "Send next gesture to the guest"
msgstr "Trimite următorul gest la invitat"

#. Translators: Documentation string for the script that toggles the control between guest and host machine.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1528
msgid "Toggles the control between guest and host machine"
msgstr "Comută controlul între calculatorul invitat și calculatorul gazdă"

#. Translators: Presented when Insert+Alt+Tab is pressed without an active remote connection.
#. Connected to the relay, but no controlled computer is in the channel.
#. Taking control now would swallow every keystroke locally.
#. Translators: Presented when Insert+Alt+Tab is pressed without an active remote connection.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1539
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1545
msgid "No remote computer is connected."
msgstr "Nu este conectat niciun computer la distanță."

#. Translators: Presented when sending keyboard keys from the controlling computer to the controlled computer.
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1569
msgid "Controlling remote machine."
msgstr "Se controlează calculatorul aflat la distanță."

#. Translators: gesture description for the toggle remote mute script
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1619
msgid "Mute or unmute the speech coming from the remote computer"
msgstr ""
"Puneți sau dați de pe mut vorbirea care vine de la calculatorul aflat la "
"distanță"

#. Translators: send Ctrl+Alt+Delete gesture description
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1628
msgid "Sends Ctrl+Alt+Delete to the remote machine"
msgstr "Trimite Ctrl+Alt+Delete la mașina de la distanță"

#. Translators: open addon settings gesture description
#: addon\globalPlugins\remoteClient\__init__.py:1636
msgid "Opens the addon settings panel inside NVDA settings dialog"
msgstr "Deschide panoul de setări de supliment în dialogul de setări NVDA"

#. Add-on summary, usually the user visible name of the addon.
#. Translators: Summary for this add-on to be shown on installation and add-on information.
#: buildVars.py:17
msgid "Tele NVDA remote assistance"
msgstr "Asistență la distanță Tele NVDA"

#. Add-on description
#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-ons manager
#: buildVars.py:20
msgid ""
"Allows remote control of and remote access to another machine. This add-on "
"is based on NVDA Remote."
msgstr ""
"Permite controlul calculatoarelor de la distanță. Acest supliment este bazat "
"pe NVDA Remote."

#. Brief changelog for this version
#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
#: buildVars.py:43
msgid ""
"Fix automatic updates that failed to complete with an \"access denied\" "
"error, recover installations stuck pending, add WebSocket relay connections "
"over HTTPS, including port 443, add Windows SSPI authentication for NTLM and "
"Kerberos HTTP proxies, improve proxy compatibility, and provide two remote "
"screenshot methods."
msgstr ""
"Remediați actualizările automate care nu s-au finalizat cu o eroare „acces "
"refuzat”, recuperați instalările blocate în așteptare, adăugați conexiuni de "
"retransmisie WebSocket prin HTTPS, inclusiv portul 443, adăugați "
"autentificare Windows SSPI pentru proxy-urile HTTP NTLM și Kerberos, "
"îmbunătățiți compatibilitatea proxy și furnizați două metode de captură de "
"ecran la distanță."

